## Three themes

| Theme         | `data-theme`      | Canvas bg   | Accent          | Borders                 |
|---------------|-------------------|-------------|-----------------|-------------------------|
| **Dark**      | `"dark"` (default)| `#0A0E0C`   | `#4FC97A` mint  | 1px white-alpha         |
| **Light**     | `"light"`         | `#F2EDE0`   | `#4FC97A` mint  | 1px dark-alpha          |
| **Brutalist** | `"brutalist"`     | `#F5EFE0`   | `#C5F4A5` lime  | 2px solid black         |

All semantic token classes switch automatically — no `dark:` prefixes needed in component code.

---

## Hard rules

- **Boxy:** `rounded-none` on all UI. `rounded-node` (4px) nodes only. `rounded-full` notification dots + avatars only.
- **Color:** Forest green + cream + neutrals + semantic status. Lime = brutalist only. Never Tailwind blue / indigo / purple / gray.
- **Borders:** Dark/light = 1px white/dark alpha tokens. Brutalist = 2px solid black. Never `border-gray-*`.
- **Shadows:** Subtle multi-layer for dark/light. Hard offset (no blur) for brutalist. Never mix on one page.
- **Layout:** Left-align text, right-align numeric columns. Never `text-center` in dashboard / list content.
- **Icons:** Lucide only. `size-4` (16px) or `size-5` (20px). `strokeWidth={1.5}`. No emoji as icons.
- **Active nav:** 2px left-edge accent sidebar. 2px bottom border tabs.
- **Card accent:** `box-shadow: inset 2px 0 0 0 <color>` — never `border-left`.

---

## Hard no-list

| Never                                      | Always                              |
|--------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------|
| `style={{ color: 'var(--...)' }}`          | `className="text-text-primary"`     |
| `bg-[var(--color-accent-primary)]`         | `bg-accent-primary`                 |
| `<style>` tags                             | `@utility` in globals.css           |
| `rounded-lg`, `rounded-xl`, `rounded-2xl` | `rounded-none` / `rounded-node`     |
| `rounded-full` on buttons                  | Only notification dots              |
| `bg-blue-500`, `text-indigo-*`             | `bg-accent-primary`, `text-forest-*`|
| Hardcoded hex in `className`               | Named token class                   |
| `shadow-2xl`, heavy soft shadows           | `shadow-lg`, `shadow-overlay`       |
| Gradient card backgrounds                  | Flat surface + border               |
| `text-center` in lists/dashboards          | `text-left` (text), `text-right` (numbers) |
| Framer Motion / GSAP                       | CSS transitions `duration-fast/base/slow` |

